DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmaaxxttmmpp driver provides support for the Maxim 6642, Maxim 6657, Maxim
     6658, Maxim 6659, Maxim 6690, National LM86, National LM89, National
     LM90, National LM99, and National LM99-1 temperature sensors.  The sensor
     possesses an internal temperature sensor and a link to an external tem‐
     perature sensor.  Both values are made available through the sysctl(8)
     interface.

